   exclusively with `--disable-gpl --disable-nonfree` via `app/src/main/cpp/build_ffmpeg.sh`.
   FFmpeg is licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License (LGPL) version 2.1
   or later; see `app/src/main/cpp/ffmpeg/COPYING.LGPLv2.1` and
   `app/src/main/cpp/ffmpeg/README.md` for details and rebuild instructions.

